ing... "I won't kill anything" and "I'm no hunter". It Just rubbed my "fur" the wrong way. <P>Sorry if I offended you guys....    <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/puppy_dog_eyes.gif">  <P>What do you mean your AR-15 is not "complete"? I've got a brand new Bushmaster if you want to buy it&gt;&gt;&gt; <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>------------------<BR>                                                                                                         <BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/FIREdevil.gif">            <FONT COLOR="ffoooo"> <B>1988 Formula 2.8L</B> V6 5 speed  </FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1">(Runs smooth, shifts crisp, red and shiny all over!)</FONT><p>[This message has been edited by REDHOTT88 (edited 12-25-2001).]||||reg||1
