Z||000017||MinnGreenGT||12-26-2001||10:56 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by REDHOTT88:<BR><B>See how easy it is to react? I think sometimes,(including myself) the written post may be interpreted different than the poster had wanted..<P>I saw two posts saying... "I won't kill anything" and "I'm no hunter". It Just rubbed my "fur" the wrong way. <P>Sorry if I offended you guys....     <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/puppy_dog_eyes.gif">   <P>What do you mean your AR-15 is not "complete"? I've got a brand new Bushmaster if you want to buy it&gt;&gt;&gt;  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No Problem... I guess I may have overreacted as well. Sorry.<P>Anyway, I've got an AR15 lower reciever (actually given as a gift)... but never have had the funding at the right time to get the upper & barrel assembly.  Not that they're really expensive or anything- just that I tend to throw most of my "spare" money at my car right now.||||reg||1
Z||000018||LarryB||12-26-2001||12:17 PM||||I'm not sure what you consider as being inexpensive, but assembled uppers from DPMS for example start at around $400-$450 including bolt & carrier assembly. <P>As an aside, you'd better confirm if that lower was manufactured before or after 9/13/1994 if you indend on installing a pre-ban upper; if you have a post-ban lower you'd be committing a felony. There are compiled lists on the 'net that can help or you can confirm with the manufacturer.<P>If it's a pre-ban lower and you don't care about having a pre-ban weapon you (or the legal owner of record, if not you) could sell it and buy a post-ban lower, pre-ban lowers now sell at a pretty substantial premium.  That should help in your quest for an upper  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>||||reg||1
Z||000019||MinnGreenGT||12-26-2001||05:12 PM||||It is a post-ban lower... and I'm not looking to do anything illegal.  So I'll be going for a matching post-ban-legal upper.  No funny stuff here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
